# Student SOS

AI-Powered Student Safety and Emergency Support System

## About
Student SOS is a web application designed to help students access emergency contacts and campus safety resources.

## Planned Features
- Student registration and login
- Emergency contacts
- SOS request submission and tracking
- Permission-based location sharing
- Student dashboard
- Staff dashboard
- AI-assisted emergency request categorization

## Technology Stack
- React
- TypeScript
- Supabase
- PostgreSQL
- GitHub
